WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:07.762
Roscoe couldn't believe it!

2
00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:11.815
Cleo was Prickly Pear's new sheriff?

3
00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:13.733
She was a thief!

4
00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:17.289
She wasn't fit to wear a badge!

5
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:22.848
"It's not right," he thought.

6
00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:28.090
Roscoe brought the Calamity Gang into town.

7
00:00:28.091 --> 00:00:34.093
Cleo was right behind him.

8
00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:38.933
Several folks stood outside town hall.

9
00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:42.808
"Who's in charge here?" Roscoe asked.

10
00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.894
"I'm Mayor Wayne," a rabbit said. "Who are you?"

11
00:00:47.895 --> 00:00:53.547
"I'm Roscoe, your new sheriff."

12
00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:57.056
He nodded toward the outlaws.

13
00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:00.702
"I just caught the Calamity Gang."

14
00:01:00.703 --> 00:01:05.573
"Well, um, thanks," Mayor Wayne said.

15
00:01:05.574 --> 00:01:08.257
"But Cleo is—"

16
00:01:08.258 --> 00:01:10.859
"A thief!" Roscoe said.

17
00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:15.156
"She stole my train ticket—and my job."

18
00:01:15.157 --> 00:01:18.377
More folks began to gather.

19
00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:23.940
Mayor Wayne looked at Cleo. "Is that true?"

20
00:01:23.941 --> 00:01:28.278
"Well, sort of," Cleo said.

21
00:01:28.279 --> 00:01:32.021
"But I did help catch the Calamity Gang."

22
00:01:32.022 --> 00:01:34.665
Roscoe folded his arms.

23
00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:39.214
"She belongs in jail too."

24
00:01:39.215 --> 00:01:49.588
He saw a pretty fox step out of the crowd.

25
00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:53.457
"You should be ashamed—saying mean things!

26
00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:55.738
Maybe Cleo was a thief.

27
00:01:55.739 --> 00:01:58.865
But she's trying to be good now!"

28
00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:02.975
Cleo smiled. "Thanks, Annie."

29
00:02:02.976 --> 00:02:05.695
Roscoe tipped his hat.

30
00:02:05.696 --> 00:02:09.583
"Sorry, miss. But I'm telling the truth."

31
00:02:09.584 --> 00:02:13.135
"Mayor!" a young owl said.

32
00:02:13.136 --> 00:02:16.793
"Cleo is still our sheriff, right?"

33
00:02:16.794 --> 00:02:19.930
The mayor bit his lip.

34
00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:24.146
"I don't know. I . . . um . . ."

35
00:02:24.147 --> 00:02:27.982
"You need to decide, Mayor!" someone shouted.

36
00:02:27.983 --> 00:02:30.966
The mayor scratched his head. "I

37
00:02:30.967 --> 00:02:34.904
know, I know. It's just . . ." "Let's

38
00:02:34.905 --> 00:02:38.521
have a contest!" Cleo said. "The

39
00:02:38.522 --> 00:02:43.425
winner will be the new sheriff." The

40
00:02:43.426 --> 00:02:53.847
mayor looked relieved. "Great idea!" ***

41
00:02:53.848 --> 00:03:00.098
The next morning everyone gathered outside town hall again.

42
00:03:00.099 --> 00:03:05.585
"The contest will have three rounds," Fritzy said.

43
00:03:05.586 --> 00:03:09.087
"Round one is a quiz."

44
00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.392
He opened a law book.

45
00:03:12.393 --> 00:03:18.092
"Cleo, Mr. Dooley let his cows graze in Mrs. Wang's field.

46
00:03:18.093 --> 00:03:21.194
Now it's covered in cow patties.

47
00:03:21.195 --> 00:03:23.783
What do you do?"

48
00:03:23.784 --> 00:03:28.778
Cleo shrugged. "Put the cows in jail?"

49
00:03:28.779 --> 00:03:33.868
"Nope," Fritzy said. "Roscoe?"

50
00:03:33.869 --> 00:03:38.643
"Tell Mr. Dooley to clean up the field," Roscoe said.

51
00:03:38.644 --> 00:03:41.451
"Correct!"

52
00:03:41.452 --> 00:03:43.845
The round went on.

53
00:03:43.846 --> 00:03:50.841
Roscoe got every answer right.

54
00:03:50.842 --> 00:03:54.426
"I won that round," he thought.

55
00:03:54.427 --> 00:04:00.746
"It looks like I'll be the new sheriff!"

56
00:04:00.747 --> 00:04:04.096
"Round two," Fritzy said.

57
00:04:04.097 --> 00:04:09.875
"Shooting slingshots!"

58
00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:13.619
Roscoe went first.

59
00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.355
His horse ran fast.

60
00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:21.338
He aimed his slingshot. Fwap! Fwap!

61
00:04:21.339 --> 00:04:24.661
He knocked two cans off a cactus.

62
00:04:24.662 --> 00:04:28.807
The crowd clapped.

63
00:04:28.808 --> 00:04:34.895
Cleo took off. Fwap! Fwap!

64
00:04:34.896 --> 00:04:39.281
She knocked two cans off a cactus with her slingshot.

65
00:04:39.282 --> 00:04:42.959
Then she leaned off the side of her horse.

66
00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:46.794
She grabbed a rock and threw it with her tail.

67
00:04:46.795 --> 00:04:51.190
Ping! A third can went down.

68
00:04:51.191 --> 00:04:56.003
The crowd cheered.

69
00:04:56.004 --> 00:05:01.418
"Cleo wins round two," Fritzy said.

70
00:05:01.419 --> 00:05:11.282
Roscoe felt ill. "I can't let Cleo win!"

